,"TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 手足有時仍易冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 排便順暢，量多，大便軟，有時細如鞭。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 小便仍黃，仍有泡沫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 體力好轉，精神好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 口渴：會，喜喝室溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 皮膚乾癬仍在，但顏色較淡，癬皮較薄。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 左腳腎石點無壓痛感但壓時仍有感覺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 緩而有力，仍有一點癆脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌淡紅苔白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方同5/7，但大黃改為3錢，並加入蟬蛻及蛇蛻各5分（另包） "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 → 3 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 清宿便剛開始排便時大便較軟。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 手腳溫度不管室溫為何都應該是熱的。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}